{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54575","headline":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久阴雾，颜色带红鲜。\n更被黄（辛本、川本、京本作「黑」）风吹上去，兵戈即日（京本作「目」）展平川，速备（京本作「避」）莫迁延。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}